                                    <li>
                                        <div class="clearfix blog-top">
                                            <a target="_blank" href="https://www.canadapetcare.com/blog/bravecto-chew-vs-topical-for-dog/">
                                                <div class="blog-top-img">
                                                    <img src="https://canadapetcare.b-cdn.net/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Bravecto-Chewable-Vs-Bravecto-Topical.jpg?class=img400" alt="Bravecto Chew vs. Bravecto Topical: Which Flea &amp;amp; Tick Treatment Is Better for Dogs?" width="100%" height="100%">

                                                </div>
                                                <div class="blog-top-title">
                                                    <span>
                                                        Bravecto Chew vs. Bravecto Topical: Which Flea &amp;amp; Tick Treatment Is Better for Dogs?
                                                    </span>
                                                </div>
